```Privileged Group Membership Change - MITRE ATT&CK T1098 (with T1136.002 account creation)```
```4728/4732/4756 = member added to a global/local/universal security group. Tuned to exclude ANONYMOUS LOGON system events from domain creation.```
index=wineventlog EventCode IN (4728,4732,4756) Group_Name IN ("Domain Admins","Enterprise Admins","Administrators","Schema Admins") src_user!="ANONYMOUS LOGON"
| table _time EventCode src_user user Group_Name
| rename src_user AS "Changed By", user AS "Account Added", Group_Name AS "Privileged Group"
